DIF-SR is built on RecBole (https://github.com/RUCAIBox/RecBole),
licensed under the MIT License (see licenses/RecBole-LICENSE.txt).

Modifications to the DIF-SR code:
- Added the proposed model SASRecDM_MTL (recbole/model/sequential_recommender/sasrecdm_mtl.py):
  a multimodal fusion module over category, image, and text representations with
  modality-specific multi-task losses.
- Added experimental model variants used during development (e.g. sasrecdm*.py).
- Changed existing files: recbole/utils/logger.py (log directory and file-suffix options),
  recbole/utils/argument_list.py, and the model registrations in
  recbole/model/sequential_recommender/__init__.py.
- Removed two backup files of an experimental variant.

New in this repository: the preprocessing pipeline (preprocess/) and its tests (tests/).
